      "content": "It sounds incredibly disheartening to feel that creative spark dimming after such a strong period of achievement. Please remember that creative ebbs and flows are a very normal part of the process, not a permanent state. Instead of focusing on recovering the past, try experimenting with completely new mediums or ideas to see what inspires a fresh connection. Sometimes stepping away from the pressure of \"being on\" allows the original energy to recharge.",
